<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-19" title="Rates, payouts & taxes" summary="Har minute ki kamaai aur payout ka hisaab samjhein.">
<p>Influencers set the per-minute price their fans pay, as they see fit. Fans are charged per minute of the phone call, at the rate the influencer sets.</p>
<h2>Influencer earnings at your own rate</h2><p>Earnings are paid by the minute spoken. Ringing, declined, cancelled and missed calls earn nothing. You choose your own whole-rupee fan price per minute. New influencers start at ₹5 a minute, ₹5 is the lowest rate, and you can raise it any time. We keep ₹2 a minute plus 40% of the rate above ₹2. You keep the rest. The part we keep includes platform fees and 18% GST, which are not added to the fan's price or deducted again from you.</p>
<p>Example at ₹20 per minute for one minute spoken: the fan pays ₹20, we keep ₹9.20 (₹2 plus 40% of the other ₹18), and you earn ₹10.80.</p>
<h2>Payouts</h2><p>Your earnings and their payout status are shown in rupees in your dashboard. New earnings are held for 7 days. After that you can withdraw them with the Payout button. We send the money to your UPI, in your own name, after a one-time ID (KYC) and UPI check. Joining needs no ID check. Test credits can be spent but not withdrawn, and earnings from calls paid with test credits cannot be withdrawn either.</p>
<h2>Taxes need final review</h2><p>PAN, TDS, GST treatment and the influencer earnings statement must be confirmed and disclosed before payouts launch. Tax obligations depend on each influencer's circumstances; seek independent tax advice if needed.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
